  <h1>Lesson 4: Links & Images in HTML</h1>
  <p>Learn How to Add Links and Images to Your Website</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="tabs">
    <button id="lessonTabBtn" class="tab-btn active" onclick="showLesson()">📖 Lesson</button>
