          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Which attribute tells where the link will go?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> src</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> href</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> alt</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> link</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Which tag is used to add an image?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> &lt;image&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> &lt;img&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> &lt;pic&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> &lt;photo&gt;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. Which attribute tells the image address?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> href</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> src</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> alt</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> link</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. What is the work of the alt attribute?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> It tells the size of the image</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> It shows text if the image does not load</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> It creates a link</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> It makes the image bold</label></div>
